Backslash should not escape the final backtick of verbatim

```
`verbatim\`
.
<p><code>verbatim\</code></p>
```

Should work the same with longer sequences of backticks

```
``verbatim\``
.
<p><code>verbatim\</code></p>
```

Backslash should not escape when using extra space

```
`` `verbatim\` ``
.
<p><code>`verbatim\`</code></p>
```

Backslash should not escape in verbatim inside tables

```
| `\` |
.
<table>
<tr>
<td><code>\</code></td>
</tr>
</table>
```

Inline verbatim with empty raw format is verbatim

```
`verbatim`{=}
.
<p><code>verbatim</code>{=}</p>
```

Only non-newline whitespace should be allowed around backticks

```
` `` `

` ``
`

`
`` `

.
<p><code>``</code></p>
<p><code>``
</code></p>
<p><code>
``</code></p>
```

```
$`math`{=not_raw}
.
<p><span class="math inline">\(math\)</span>{=not_raw}</p>
```

```
\$$`math`
.
<p>$<span class="math inline">\(math\)</span></p>
```

```
\\$$`math`
.
<p>\<span class="math display">\[math\]</span></p>
```
